name: Same-Sex Partnership Act (SSPA)
description: SR 211.231 — Federal Act of 18 June 2004 on the Registered Partnership between Same-Sex Couples (Same-Sex Partnership Act, SSPA). Unofficial English mirror of the Fedlex consolidation of 1 January 2025. No legal force.
